    {%- comment -%} ===== VIEW: ROOTED — Light the Path (concise overview → deeper dive in the Evergreens) ===== {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- assign evergreens_url = section.settings.evergreens_url | default: '/pages/realm-5' -%}
