      {%- comment -%} the 6 stages (letter^name^one-liner) — spell ROOTED down the trail {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- capture os_rooted -%}R^Reach^Warm up the right people before you sell a thing.|O^Open^Open the loop — build anticipation with pre-launch content.|O^Offer^Make the offer. The doors open, and it's for sale.|T^Trigger^Give them a reason to decide now — proof and gentle urgency.|E^Escalate^The close — last call as the window starts to narrow.|D^Deepen^Keep the relationship going long after launch day.{%- endcapture -%}
