            <div class="osx-mate-haus">The Idea Haus <span class="osx-mate-dot">•</span> <i>Where brilliant ideas begin</i></div>
            <p>Blunt, no-fluff, and built for sellers. Bring Frank a raw idea and he turns it into sellable designs, content and copy — filtering the weak concepts and sharpening the strong ones.</p>
            <div class="osx-mate-for"><b>Ask him for</b> marketing, writing, e-commerce and product-design direction &mdash; profit over generic creativity.</div>
