          <details><summary>What order should I work in?</summary><div class="osx-fa"><p>Top to bottom down the sidebar: find your direction, lock your Brand DNA, then Content, Graphics, Project, Marketing — and launch with ROOTED. Each step feeds the next.</p></div></details>
          <details><summary>Where does my work get saved?</summary><div class="osx-fa"><p>Your brand kit and progress live in your account and this browser. Sign in on any device to pick up where you left off, and use each Haus's Export button to keep your own copy.</p></div></details>
